 "data": [
  {
   "uuid": "9a26bc89-a35b-4317-adfd-ec4a285d7e72",
   "slug": "a23-helmet-woodland",
   "name": "A23 Flight Helmet Woodland",
   "class_name": "cds_undersuit_helmet_01_01_01",
   "classification": "FPS.Armor.Helmet",
   "classification_label": "Helmet",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The A23 has been one of CDS' mainstay helmet systems for years. Built out of impact-resistant composite technology and a hardened laminate faceplate, the A23 is perfect for hazardous environment and basic EVA operations. Visor is AR crosshair compatible.",
    "de_DE": "Typ (En): Flight Helmet\nTyp (De): Pilotenhelm\n\nDer A23 ist seit Jahren eines der wichtigsten Helmsysteme von CDS. Hergestellt aus schlagfester Verbundtechnologie und mit einer geh\u00e4rteten Laminat-Sichtscheibe ist der A23 perfekt f\u00fcr gef\u00e4hrliche Umgebungen und grundlegende EVA-Operationen. Das Visier unterst\u00fctzt AR-Fadenkreuze.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u98de\u884c\u5934\u76d4\n\u4f24\u5bb3\u51cf\u514d\uff1a15%\n\u9002\u7528\u6e29\u5ea6\uff1a-30 / 60 \u6444\u6c0f\u5ea6\n\u8f90\u5c04\u9632\u62a4\uff1a15200 \u96f7\u59c6\n\u8f90\u5c04\u6e05\u9664\u7387\uff1a81 \u96f7\u59c6 / \u79d2\n\n\u591a\u5e74\u6765\uff0cA23\u4e00\u76f4\u662f\u5361\u62c9\u514b\u9632\u5fa1\u7cfb\u7edf\u7684\u4e3b\u8981\u5934\u76d4\u7cfb\u7edf\u4e4b\u4e00\u3002A 23\u91c7\u7528\u6297\u51b2\u51fb\u590d\u5408\u6750\u6599\u6280\u672f\u7684\u786c\u5316\u5c42\u538b\u9762\u677f\u5236\u6210\uff0c\u975e\u5e38\u9002\u5408\u5371\u9669\u73af\u5883\u548c\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u592a\u7a7a\u884c\u8d70\u6d3b\u52a8\u3002\u8be5\u5934\u76d4\u9762\u7f69\u517c\u5bb9AR\u5341\u5b57\u51c6\u661f\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Armure L\u00e9g\u00e8re\nR\u00e9duction des d\u00e9g\u00e2ts : 10%\nTemp\u00e9rature de fonctionnement : -30 / 60 \u00b0C\nProtection contre les radiations : 15200 REM\nNeutralisation des radiations : 81 REM/s\n\nLe A23 a \u00e9t\u00e9 l'un des syst\u00e8mes de casques principaux de CDS pendant des ann\u00e9es. Construit \u00e0 partir d'une technologie composite r\u00e9sistante aux impacts et d'une visi\u00e8re lamin\u00e9e durcie, le A23 est parfait pour les environnements dangereux et les op\u00e9rations EVA de base. La visi\u00e8re est compatible avec le r\u00e9ticule en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 augment\u00e9e."
   },
