   "uuid": "c92273b0-2d7f-41b3-9fdd-af07e190a0f3",
   "slug": "ace-interceptor-helmet",
   "name": "Ace Interceptor Helmet",
   "class_name": "basl_combat_light_helmet_02_01_01",
   "classification": "FPS.Armor.Helmet",
   "classification_label": "Helmet",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The unique open-faced design makes the Ace Interceptor helmet a lightweight and liberating option for operating in atmosphere. It features precisely layered plating to protect the head from a variety of combat and environmental hazards and an impact resistant, anti-glare visor over the eyes. Visor is AR crosshair compatible.",
    "de_DE": "Typ (En): Racing Helmet\nTyp (De): Rennhelm\n\nDas einzigartige, offene Design macht den Ace Interceptor-Helm zu einer leichten und angenehmen Wahl f\u00fcr Eins\u00e4tze innerhalb von Atmosph\u00e4ren. Er verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber pr\u00e4zise geschichtete Panzerung zum Schutz des Kopfes vor verschiedensten Kampf- und Umwelteinfl\u00fcssen sowie \u00fcber ein sto\u00dffestes, blendfreies Visier. Das Visier unterst\u00fctzt AR-Fadenkreuze.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u7ade\u901f\u5934\u76d4\n\u4f24\u5bb3\u51cf\u514d\uff1a5%\n\u9002\u7528\u6e29\u5ea6\uff1a-35 / 65 \u6444\u6c0f\u5ea6\n\u8f90\u5c04\u9632\u62a4\uff1a26000 \u96f7\u59c6\n\u8f90\u5c04\u6e05\u9664\u7387\uff1a145.8 \u96f7\u59c6 / \u79d2\n\n\u738b\u724c \u622a\u51fb\u8005 \u5934\u76d4\u91c7\u7528\u72ec\u7279\u7684\u5f00\u653e\u5f0f\u8bbe\u8ba1\uff0c\u91cd\u91cf\u8f7b\uff0c\u9002\u5408\u5728\u5927\u6c14\u5c42\u4e2d\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002\u8be5\u5934\u76d4\u91c7\u7528\u7cbe\u786e\u5206\u5c42\u7684\u7535\u9540\u5c42\uff0c\u53ef\u4fdd\u62a4\u5934\u90e8\u514d\u53d7\u5404\u79cd\u6218\u6597\u548c\u73af\u5883\u5371\u5bb3\u7684\u4f24\u5bb3\uff0c\u773c\u775b\u4e0a\u8fd8\u6709\u4e00\u4e2a\u6297\u51b2\u51fb\u3001\u9632\u7729\u76ee\u7684\u9762\u7f69\u3002\u9762\u7f69\u4e0eAR\u5341\u5b57\u51c6\u661f\u517c\u5bb9\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Armure L\u00e9g\u00e8re\nR\u00e9duction des d\u00e9g\u00e2ts : 20 %\nTemp\u00e9rature de fonctionnement : -35 / 65 \u00b0C\nProtection contre les radiations : 26000 REM\nNeutralisation des radiations : 145,8 REM/s\n\nLe design unique \u00e0 visage d\u00e9couvert du casque Ace Interceptor lui conf\u00e8re l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9 et libert\u00e9 de mouvement en atmosph\u00e8re. Il est compos\u00e9 de plaques superpos\u00e9es avec pr\u00e9cision pour prot\u00e9ger la t\u00eate des dangers li\u00e9s au combat ou \u00e0 l'environnement, et int\u00e8gre une visi\u00e8re antireflet r\u00e9sistante aux impacts recouvrant les yeux. La visi\u00e8re est compatible avec le r\u00e9ticule AR."
   },
